<view class="canvas-bg theme-{{theme}}" wx:if="{{!reduceMotion}}"></view>

<view class="page {{reduceMotion ? 'no-motion' : ''}} theme-{{theme}}">
  <view class="navbar" style="padding-top: {{statusBarHeight}}px;">
    <view class="nav-btn tap" hover-class="nav-btn-hover" bindtap="onBack">
      <view class="ic ic-xs ic-back"></view>
    </view>
    <text class="nav-title">本位币</text>
    <view class="nav-spacer"></view>
  </view>

  <view class="bc-hint entry-up">
    切换本位币会把全部账户与历史净值重新折算到新货币显示，金额口径随之改变。这是个少见的全局操作，且仅改变显示、不改动已记录数据。
  </view>

  <view class="bc-list entry-up">
    <view
      wx:for="{{currencies}}"
      wx:key="code"
      class="bc-row {{item.code === current ? 'sel' : ''}}"
      data-code="{{item.code}}"
      bindtap="onPick"
      hover-class="row-hover"
    >
      <view class="bc-sym">{{item.symbol}}</view>
      <view class="bc-info">
        <text class="bc-code">{{item.code}} {{item.name}}</text>
        <text class="bc-sub" wx:if="{{item.minorDigits === 0}}">无小数位</text>
      </view>
      <text class="bc-check" wx:if="{{item.code === current}}">✓</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
